### ==========================================
### 1. 测试保存配置产生 Commit A (0.19.8.9.3)
### ==========================================
PUT http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/configuration
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "yaml": "version: 1\nproject:\n  name: test-v1"
}


### ==========================================
### 2. 测试保存配置产生 Commit B (0.19.8.9.3)
### ==========================================
PUT http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/configuration
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "yaml": "version: 2\nproject:\n  name: test-v2"
}


### ==========================================
### 3. 测试 History 接口 (0.19.8.9.4)
### ==========================================
# @name getHistory
GET http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/git/history
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 请从上方 History 响应中复制两个 commitId，分别填入下方的变量中：
@oldCommit = 77382109bcb19b0dea408a83b5acebc766a6c63c
@newCommit = db88edf86eff881bd74a0af838e171b506418269


### ==========================================
### 4. 测试 Diff 接口 (0.19.8.9.5)
### ==========================================
GET http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/git/diff?from={{oldCommit}}&to={{newCommit}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}


### ==========================================
### 5. 测试权限校验 - 越权访问 (0.19.8.9.6)
### ==========================================
# 使用非所有者的普通用户 Token (请替换为普通用户的 Token)
@nonOwnerToken = Bearer OTHER_USER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

GET http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/git/history
Authorization: {{nonOwnerToken}}
# 预期返回: 403 Forbidden


### ==========================================
### 6. 测试 Restore 还原 (0.19.8.9.7 & 0.19.8.9.8)
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/git/restore
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commitId": "{{oldCommit}}"
}

###
POST http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/2/git/restore
Authorization:{{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commitId": "77382109bcb19b0dea408a83b5acebc766a6c63c"
}


### ==========================================
### 7. 最终验证缓存与配置是否刷新 (检查控制台日志 0.19.8.9.9)
### ==========================================
GET http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}